a-drupal-selector=\"edit-actions\" class=\"form-actions js-form-wrapper form-wrapper\" id=\"edit-actions\"><input class=\"search-form__submit button js-form-submit form-submit\" data-drupal-selector=\"edit-submit\" type=\"submit\" id=\"edit-submit\" value=\"Search\" />\n</div>\n\n</form>\n\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n                    </div>  \n                  </div>\n                                \n                  \n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</header>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t   \t\t\n\t\t<div role=\"main\" class=\"main main-page\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"clearfix\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"help gav-help-region\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"clearfix\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"clearfix\"></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"content content-full\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container container-bg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-main-inner\">\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t<div id=\"page-main-content\" class=\"main-content col-xl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 order-xl-2 order-lg-2 order-md-1 order-sm-1 order-xs-1 \">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"main-content-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content-main\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  <div>\n    <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div><div id=\"block-daudo-subtheme-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block no-title\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"content block-content\">\n      \n<!-- Start Display article for teaser page -->\n<!-- Start Display article for detail page -->\n\n<article data-history-node-id=\"625\" class=\"node node-detail node--type-article node--promoted node--view-mode-full clearfix\">\n  <div class=\"post-block\">\n      \n    <div class=\"post-thumbnail post-standard\">\n              \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item\">\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2026-07/HOAgdip.jpeg\" alt=\"Multi-Agency Team Reviews HoAGDP Progress, Charts Way Forward for Faster Implementation  Works Building,\" />\n\n</div>\n</div>\n      \n        \n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"post-content\">\n      \n         <h1 class=\"post-title\">\n<span>Multi-Agency Team Reviews HoAGDP Progress, Charts Way Forward for Faster Implementation  Works Building, Nairobi</span>\n</h1>\n               \n      <div class=\"post-meta\">\n        <span class=\"post-categories\">  <span class=\"post-categories\" ><a href=\"/allnews\" hreflang=\"en\">News</a></span>\n</span><span class=\"line\">/</span><span class=\"post-created\"> Fri, 07/03/2026 - 08:44 </span>\n      </div>\n      \n              <div class=\"node__meta hidden\">\n          <article>\n  </article>\n\n          <span>\n            Submitted by \n<span><span>roads-admin</span></span>\n on July 3, 2026          </span>\n          \n        </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>&nbsp;Principal Secretary, Eng. Joseph Mbugua, on Thursday chaired the Horn of Africa Gateway Development Project (HoAGDP) Multi-Agency Implementation Support Mission Wrap-Up Meeting and the Second Quarter 2026 Project Oversight Committee Meeting to review implementation progress and agree on measures to accelerate project delivery.</p><p>The meeting focused on fast-tracking key procurements, strengthening project oversight, enhancing road safety, and expediting land acquisition and compensation to ensure timely implementation.</p><p>Eng. Mbugua confirmed that implementation of the HoAGDP is progressing well, with contracts for all road sections and fibre optic infrastructure already awarded. He further noted that the approval of the Second Horn of Africa Gateway Development Project (HoAGDP II), together with additional financing, has secured funding for the entire 740-kilometre Isiolo–Mandera Road Corridor.</p><p>Once completed, the project is expected to enhance regional connectivity, facilitate trade, expand digital infrastructure, and unlock socio-economic opportunities across Northern Kenya and the wider Horn of Africa region.</p><p>The meeting was attended by the World Bank team and representatives from the State Department for Roads, the State Department for Transport, the Ministry of Information, Communications and the Digital Economy (MICDE), the State Department for Public Works, the National Transport and Safety Authority (NTSA), the Kenya National Highways Authority (KeNHA), the Kenya Urban Roads Authority (KURA), the Kenya Rural Roads Authority (KeRRA), Kenya Railways Corporation, the National Land Commission (NLC), the Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA), &nbsp;the Directorate of Occupational Safety and Health Services (DOSHS), the National Construction Authority (NCA), the Kenya Roads Board (KRB), the University of Nairobi (UoN), and the Engineers Board of Kenya (EBK).</p><p>#SeamlessConnectivity | #BeyondTheHighway | #HoAGDP</p></div>\n      <div class=\"gavias-builder--content\"></div>\n      </div>\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</article>\n\n<!-- End Display article for detail page -->\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<!-- Sidebar Left -->\n\t\t\t\t<!-- End Sidebar Left -->\n\n\t\t<!-- Sidebar Right -->\n\t\t\t\t<!-- End Sidebar Right -->\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t\n<footer id=\"footer\" class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n    \n         \n     <div class=\"footer-center\">\n        <div class=\"container\">    